# sources.pdl - the reader's menu, in display order. It is read directly by the event's `run_menu` command (mr_run_menu.c); there is no generated copy to keep in sync.
#   SOURCE | order | action | label
# order  = a number; rows are shown in ascending order.
# action = a plain identifier (letters, digits, _): the folder under ../branches/ whose run.sh runs when the row is picked. A row whose branch has no run.sh is skipped with a note.
# Edit a row here (or in blueprintz) to change the menu; the reader's event is  run_menu menu=<this file>.
SOURCE | 1 | tao | Tao Te Ching (random chapter)
SOURCE | 2 | proverbs31 | Proverbs 31 (daily)
SOURCE | 3 | bible_tts | Bible verse (with TTS)
SOURCE | 4 | bible_text | Bible verse (text)
